# Career Pipeline Overview

This workspace runs a structured job search: resume design, exports, and application tracking with AI-assisted workflows from the **career-pipeline** plugin.

## Folder map

| Folder | Purpose |
|--------|---------|
| `1 - Design/` | Editable source files (resume, cover letter template) |
| `1 - Design/Exports/` | Finished PDFs ready to submit |
| `2 - Leads/` | Company research profiles produced by `source-leads` |
| `3 - Applications/` | Per-company, per-role application tracking |
| `3 - Applications/# - Archive/` | Closed applications |
| `4 - Reference/` | Candidate profile and shared reference docs |

## Application path

Live: `3 - Applications/<Company>/<Job Title>/`

## Leads path

Company research: `2 - Leads/<Company>.md`

## Personal context

Read `4 - Reference/candidate-profile.md` for salary floor, location preferences, target roles, background facts, and file naming patterns. Do not hardcode candidate-specific details in rules or skills.

## Workflows

Invoke skills explicitly: `source-leads`, `analyze-job`, `initial-interview`, `next-interview`, `archive-job`. Human workflow guide: root `README.md`.
